<title>USA: Thomas &amp; Betts names Moore CEO.</title>
<headline>Thomas &amp; Betts names Moore CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts Corp said Monday it named president and chief operating officer Clyde Moore to the post of president and chief executive officer effective May 7.</p>
<p>Kevin Dunnigan, currently chairman and chief executive, will remain chairman.</p>
